{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This Prussian-born musician/impresario began as a cigar manufacturer. In 1899 he built his first music venue in New York City. It was the first of many. He, his sons and grandsons formed a dynasty that was very influential in American entertainment.","Oscar Hammerstein"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"celebrities\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
